  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A long lace scarf worked flat in a repeating fan stitch. Each repeat is 12 stitches wide and four rows tall, so the scarf grows quickly once the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "fan-stitch"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "fan stitch"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " rhythm is established."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "foundation-chain"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "foundation chain"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " sets the width at 37 stitches, giving three fans across. The scarf is worked to approximately 180 cm, then fastened off. Both short ends receive a picot border for a neat finish."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "suppliesCard",
        "attrs": {
          "heading": "Materials",
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "Fingering weight yarn",
              "qty": "200 g",
              "substitutions": "A smooth plied fingering in wool, cotton, or a blend all work well."
            },
            {
              "name": "3.5 mm crochet hook",
              "qty": "1"
            },
            {
              "name": "Tapestry needle",
              "qty": "1"
            },
            {
              "name": "Craft scissors",
              "qty": "1 pair"
            },
            {
              "name": "Soft measuring tape",
              "qty": "1"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Gauge"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "One fan repeat (12 sts, 4 rows) = 6 cm wide by 3 cm tall in fingering with a 3.5 mm hook after wet blocking. Work one full repeat as a swatch and measure before starting. A wider swatch is more reliable than a single repeat."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Finished size"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Approximately 18 cm wide by 180 cm long after blocking."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Stitches used"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "bulletList",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "ch: chain"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "dc (UK) / sc (US): double crochet, one loop only, short stitch"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "tr (UK) / dc (US): treble, one yarn-over before inserting hook"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                        "attrs": {
                          "termSlug": "fan-stitch"
                        }
                      }
                    ],
                    "text": "fan stitch"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ": five trebles into the same stitch"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "listItem",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "sl st: slip stitch"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Pattern"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Foundation: chain 37."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Row 1 (right side)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Work 1 dc into the 4th ch from hook. *Skip 2 ch, work 5 tr into the next ch (one fan made), skip 2 ch, work 1 dc into the next ch*. Repeat from * to * to end. Turn. (3 fans, 4 dc.)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Row 2"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "turning-chain"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "Turning chain"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " of 3 (counts as first tr). Work 2 tr into the first dc. *Skip 2 tr, dc into the centre tr of the next fan, skip 2 tr, work 5 tr into the next dc*. Repeat, ending with 3 tr into the last dc. Turn."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Row 3"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Ch 1. Dc into the first tr. *Skip 2 tr, work 5 tr into the next dc, skip 2 tr, dc into the centre tr of the next fan*. Repeat to end, dc into the top of the turning chain. Turn."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Row 4"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "As Row 2."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Repeat Rows 3 and 4 until the scarf measures approximately 180 cm. Fasten off."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Picot border"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Rejoin yarn to one short end. *Sl st into the next st, ch 3, sl st into the same st (one picot made)*. Repeat along the short edge. Fasten off. Repeat on the other short end."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Finishing"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Weave in all ends with the tapestry needle. Wet block by soaking in cool water, pressing gently, then pinning out to the full dimensions on a flat surface. Leave to dry completely before removing pins."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}